# Kung Pao Roasted Broccoli

Based on [Chrissy Teigen Cravings Hungry for More](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/553580/cravings-hungry-for-more-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250616010240/https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/553580/cravings-hungry-for-more-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/)), pg. 141

{ rating="5" image="kung_pao_roasted_broccoli.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Broccoli

- [ ] 1/4 cup [vegetable oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [sesame oil]{ ing="sesame-oil" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [cayenne pepper]{ ing="cayenne-pepper" }
- [ ] 2 lbs [broccoli]{ ing="broccoli" } (2 smaller heads)
- [ ] [salt and pepper]{ ing="salt-and-pepper" }

### Kung Pao Sauce

- [ ] 1/4 cup [Thai sweet chili sauce]{ ing="thai-sweet-chili-sauce" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [oyster sauce]{ ing="oyster-sauce" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [sesame oil]{ ing="sesame-oil" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [vegetable oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" }
- [ ] 1.5 Tbsp [Sriracha]{ ing="sriracha" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [unseasoned rice vinegar]{ ing="unseasoned-rice-vinegar" }
- [ ] 2 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, finely minced

### Garnish

- [ ] 1/2 cup [chopped salted roasted peanuts]{ ing="chopped-salted-roasted-peanuts" }
- [ ] 1 [scallion thinly sliced]{ ing="scallion-thinly-sliced" }
- [ ] 1 fresh [jalapeno]{ ing="jalapeno" }, sliced into rings

## Recipe

1. Preheat oven or air fryer to 400°F
1. Cut the [broccoli]{ ing="broccoli" } into florets, stems peeled and cut into 1/4” thick rounds
1. In a bowl, whisk together the [oils]{ ing="sesame-oil" } and [cayenne pepper]{ ing="cayenne-pepper" }. Toss the [broccoli]{ ing="broccoli" } with the mixture and season with [salt and pepper]{ ing="salt-and-pepper" }
1. **Oven:** Spread on a rimmed baking sheet and roast until edges are blackened and crisp (20-25 min). **Air Fryer:** Arrange in basket in a single layer (work in batches if needed) and cook until charred and crisp (10-12 min), shaking halfway
1. Meanwhile, whisk together the [sauce]{ ing="oyster-sauce" } in a medium bowl
1. **Oven:** Toss [broccoli]{ ing="broccoli" } with [sauce]{ ing="oyster-sauce" } directly on the pan, then broil until [sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } is thick and bubbling (4-5 min). **Air Fryer:** Transfer broccoli to a bowl, toss with [sauce]{ ing="thai-sweet-chili-sauce" }, return to air fryer and cook until sauce is thick and bubbling (2-3 min)
1. Transfer to a serving platter and garnish with [peanuts]{ ing="chopped-salted-roasted-peanuts" }, scallions, and [jalapeno]{ ing="jalapeno" }.
Optionally, serve over rice
